# Copy these lines into `.env.local` in the project root (that file is gitignored).
#
# --- Production (Vercel) — required or the site shows “Email service is not configured” ---
# 1. Vercel Dashboard → your project → Settings → Environment Variables
# 2. Add RESEND_API_KEY = (same value as in .env.local). Enable for Production (and Preview if desired).
# 3. Redeploy: Deployments → … on latest → Redeploy (or push any commit).
#
# RESEND_API_KEY=   → Create at https://resend.com/api-keys
#
# Optional after you verify your domain in Resend (recommended for production):
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Maverick Website <contact@maverickprocure.com>
#
# If RESEND_FROM_EMAIL is omitted, the API uses Resend’s test sender
# "Maverick Website <onboarding@resend.dev>" (subject to Resend’s sending rules).

RESEND_API_KEY=
